			],
			"Message": "build(Sky): Update Astro, Vite, and compiler-rs dependencies\n\nBump three build dependencies in package.json to their latest patch releases:\n- `astro` from 6.3.5 to 6.3.7 — bug fixes and minor improvements.\n- `vite` from 8.0.13 to 8.0.14 — patch-level Vite fixes.\n- `@astrojs/compiler-rs` from 0.2.0 to 0.2.1 — compiler-rs patch update.\n\nAll bumps are semver-compatible patches with no breaking changes.",
			"SHA": "e490656409ec3705ea119e3613412cb201255544"
		},
